   "text": "super fun weekend meeting the @eltoadpepe cto team and @slingoorio; had a serendipitous moment on the exercise bike yesterday morning\n\n@sapijiju and @a1lon9 had asked me for feedback on the updated @pumpfun mobile app, i told them i was going to give the social feed a try\n\nbought the first coin i saw 3-4 people mention that looked like it had a good narrative, threw in ~ $200, wanted to see if the feed could lead to some motion\n\nsolana:A13oRB9FFaiUjfi6LdCg6p9ka1u8SfGkUFs4SKvPpump started moving immediately, i went out with the family for a bit, @slingoorio sent me a good chunk of supply (thank you sir \ud83e\udee1), i looked at my wallet a few hours later and said \"whoaaaaa\"\n\nnow we're off to the races - fully transitioning this into a community coin with the @eltoadpepe team, highlighting the unique attributes of pump as a social platform and the awesome traders and people commenting and having fun together with memes and trends\n\ni obviously will never sell any of the tokens in my possession, so it's a matter of getting them out to the community, people who love trading and having a good time; spreading the love, paying it forward\n\na bunch of folks will be helping me with this, lfg\n\n\ud83d\udc38",
